---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { NFA_LONG, SITE } from '../lib/site';
const updated = '2026-10-11';
---

<Base title="Disclaimer" description={`Not-financial-advice disclaimer for ${SITE.name}.`} path="/disclaimer">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="nfa">
        <span><strong>Not financial advice.</strong> {NFA_LONG}</span>
      </div>

      <h2>Informational use only</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} publishes aggregated news, market snapshots, and algorithmic signals for informational
        purposes. Nothing on this site or served by the API constitutes financial, investment, legal, or
        tax advice, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any asset.
      </p>

      <h2>Signals are not predictions</h2>
      <p>
        Signals are produced by deterministic indicators on our own collected price data, and state a
        direction word — <code>Rising</code>, <code>Falling</code>, <code>Steady</code>, or{' '}
        <code>Choppy</code> — with the measured reason. They describe what the numbers show. They are not
        predictions, not probabilities, and not advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
      <p>
        Data is derived from third-party sources and may be delayed, incomplete, or inaccurate. There is no
        SLA, and features, limits, and coverage may change without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Risk</h2>
      <p>
        Trading and holding cryptocurrencies involves substantial risk, including total loss. Past
        performance does not indicate future results. Never invest more than you can afford to lose, and
        consult a qualified professional before making financial decisions.
      </p>

      <h2>Attribution</h2>
      <p>
        News content is republished with attribution to its source. API users must display “Powered by{' '}
        {SITE.name}” with a link to {SITE.domain}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
